  "notes": [
    "The same unlisted Workshop item has been restored to the existing signed v08 single-player ws4_entry route, sequence 2026102503, content 88611d026e49c52b5bce7324818f36a11a60059a2844b8f646b884ba15debaa9 and new manifest 3443060898060848239. The restoration submission and official fresh download were fully verified; this is a new successful restoration, not a rewrite of the original failed v08 attempt.",
    "The current advertised entry is ws4_entry with one slot; it reopens the same item on template_map. The internal gameplay declaration remains four, but direct playable multiplayer has not been delivered.",
    "The v09 diagnostic was uploaded and its official 6630-file, four-volume, five-VPK download passed full signed CRC/hash verification after explicit existing-item subscription refresh. It was then rejected as a playable route because ordinary non-Tools GC authentication remained WS4-WEB-04/start/create/0 after normal Start and manual refresh.",
    "The ordinary v09 test had one real player, four visible slots, sv_cheats=false and GAME_IN_PROGRESS with a genuine GC match. Initial ScriptVM and legacy factories returned nil request objects; later phase probe events were not observed. No all-phase coverage or real two-player success is claimed.",
    "Bare changelevel template_map ended with CLIENT_NO_MAP and the owned Dota process exited. It is not offered as a way to retain multiplayer clients. The v09 source, signed candidate and diagnostic evidence remain preserved in multiplayer_entry_20261025.json.",
    "The restored v08 original-entry handoff, GAME_IN_PROGRESS and single-player N1 gameplay were newly observed on manifest 3443060898060848239 in Steam-launched process 33636, which was left running. See output/arcade_multiplayer_20261025/ordinary_restored_v08/result.json. Per-click authorization attribution was not instrumented and specific cloud-save values were not reaudited; this observation does not inherit historical acceptance or verify two-player play.",
    "Title, description, cover, visibility and four-account roster are preserved. Independent test archives, online cheat denial, disabled real-money payments and trusted rankings remain unchanged; temporary Steam TLS egress still requires the author PC online.",
    "Original v05 receipts, the original failed v08 pending journal and raw failure evidence remain immutable. Restoration facts are recorded separately."
  ],
